  # Presenter Notes Generator

  Generate detailed, natural-sounding speaker notes for each slide to guide the presenter during delivery.

  ## Procedure
  1. Review the slide headline and key bullets to identify the core message.
  2. Draft conversational talking points explaining the 'why' behind each bullet point.
  3. Include anticipated audience questions and recommended responses.
  4. Add timing guidance (e.g., spend 1-2 minutes on this slide) and smooth transition phrases to the next topic.
